Package: erodist-control-center
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: EroDist Project <erodist@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, erodist-icons
Recommends: systemsettings, plasma-discover, plasma-nm, wine
Description: EroDist Settings Center for KDE Plasma 6
 Native Qt desktop application with categorized KDE settings and local system information.
 No telemetry, privileged helper, edition installer or background service.
